/.quarto/
_site/
_site-staging/
# The drafts tree is a projection of the private notes graph (its journal is the source) —
# never committed; only the staging index page, profile chrome, is.
/drafts/*
!/drafts/index.qmd
# The series and topic pages are projected from the notes graph by site-build (design e240183f):
# build output at the location each page's site_path derives, never committed.
/series/*/*.qmd
# The Library index and its work pages (design 638b7b85): projected the same way.
/library/index.qmd
/library/*/index.qmd
# The project logs' index and the log Series pages under it (design 7657c4a5): projected the same way.
/logs/index.qmd
/logs/*/index.qmd
# The blog page, the site's category listing (design ce17606b (3)): projected from the blog Lens
# the same way.
/blog.qmd
# The home page (design e55201e2, amendment 5c3c2662): projected from the home Lens the same way.
/index.qmd
# The About page (design ff0c6338, amendment 2364f215): projected from the About Lens the same way.
/about.qmd
# The category index and the category pages (design a62f2499): projected from the categories
# Lens and the facet vocabulary the same way.
/categories/index.qmd
/categories/*/index.qmd
# The derived-blocks filter, its data and its render report (design 253ac996): generated by
# site-build from the notes graph.
/_derived/
/fonts/
.*
/.luarc.json

**/*.quarto_ipynb
